>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/250363\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib (от Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226779\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Mob Spawning on Trees (от oldjunyi)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/253449\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla (от TehNut)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225604\" rel=\"nofollow\">InGame Info XML (от Lunatrius)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/246795\" rel=\"nofollow\">ViesCraft - Airships! (от Viesis_Gaming)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/235261\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just a Few Fish (от Tmtravlr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/238857\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Questing - Standard Expansion (от Funwayguy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/227049\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Backpacks (от gr8pefish)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/251136\" rel=\"nofollow\">Level Up! Reloaded (от BeetoGuy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/238372\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neat (от Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/245755\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones (от BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237414\" rel=\"nofollow\">RealBench (от Prototik)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/229708\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farseek (от delvr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/282415\" rel=\"nofollow\">Primitive Mobs (от Daveyx0)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225903\" rel=\"nofollow\">Garden Stuff (от jaquadro)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/220954\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModTweaker (от jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223852\" rel=\"nofo